title: Barracuda CloudGen Firewall: VPN Users
agents: snmp
catalog: app/barracuda
license: GPLv2
distribution: phion
description:
 This check monitors the number of concurrently connected client-to-site
 VPN users on a Barracuda CloudGen Firewall, as reported by the
 Phion-MIB.

 Upper levels can be configured via the ruleset "Phion/Barracuda VPN
 Users".

discovery:
 One service named {VPN Users} is created per device.
